// Terminology aliases carried over from the IHE supplement template.
// DPOW is an HL7 v2.5.1 messaging profile and defines NO FHIR conformance
// resources (no StructureDefinitions or CapabilityStatements). These aliases
// are retained so the project matches the template layout and so any future
// FHIR mapping work (see the Extended Issues "FHIR Interoperability Layer"
// discussion) has a starting point. They currently have no referencing FSH.
Alias: SCT = http://snomed.info/sct
Alias: UCUM = http://unitsofmeasure.org
Alias: LOINC = http://loinc.org
Alias: DCM = http://dicom.nema.org/resources/ontology/DCM
